      en: ["Small hamlet with a long settlement history", "Archaeological finds dating from the Bronze Age", "Traditional Rhine Valley architecture partially preserved", "Located at the foot of the Eschnerberg", "Preferred residential area with a village character", "Starting point for various historical hiking trails"],
